---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="How We Work — 1404 | How we solve problems"
  description="How 1404 approaches problems. We take something complex, treat it immediately with the simplest solution that works, then refine it iteratively until it holds up for the long term."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-40 pb-24 md:pb-32">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-20">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-text-primary leading-tight">
        How we work
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-text-secondary text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Every company solves problems its own way. Here is ours.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- The philosophy -->
    <div class="mb-24">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-primary mb-6 max-w-3xl">
        Take a complex problem, treat it immediately, then cure it iteratively.
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        <p>
          We start by making a complex problem simple. We find the smallest solution that actually works, put it in front of you fast, and get it doing real work. Then we spend the real time on it, working through the complexity underneath and refining it until it holds up for the long term.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most technology work runs the other way. It tries to design for every edge case up front, takes months to ship, and often solves a problem that has already moved. Starting simple means you see the value early. Refining over time means the solution keeps working as your business grows into it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The method -->
    <div class="mb-20 border-t border-border pt-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-primary mb-12">
        The same three steps, on every problem.
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-12">

        <div class="border-l-2 border-copper pl-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-3xl md:text-4xl text-copper mb-4 tracking-wide">01</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-primary mb-3">Investigate</h3>
          <p class="text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            We find where the problem is actually stemming from. Not the symptom you noticed, but the root underneath it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-2 border-copper pl-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-3xl md:text-4xl text-copper mb-4 tracking-wide">02</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-primary mb-3">Understand</h3>
          <p class="text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            We learn how the problem arises and think through what a real solution looks like. What is the simplest version that solves it, and where the complexity will actually live once your work runs through it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-2 border-copper pl-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-3xl md:text-4xl text-copper mb-4 tracking-wide">03</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-primary mb-3">Build</h3>
          <p class="text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            We build that solution and put it to work fast, then refine it iteratively. Each pass optimizes it against how your business really operates, until it is solved for the long term, not just for today.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <CTABanner />
</PageLayout>
